# Vendored CC0 source packs — fetched, never committed.
#
# These are other people's bytes. The repo commits the *ledger*
# (art-recipes/sources.jsonl) and the *lockfile* (art-recipes/sources.lock.json),
# which together let anyone reproduce this directory exactly:
#
#     npm run art:vendor
#
# Same reasoning as art/ in Appendix B — binaries live outside git.
*
!.gitignore
